    {
      "id": 2161,
      "slug": "emperor-of-solo-play",
      "title": "Emperor of Solo Play",
      "alt_titles": [
        "\u5b64\u72ec\u300a\u30bd\u30ed\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u300b\u306e\u5e1d\u738b",
        "\u55ae\u5237\u738b\u8005",
        "\uc194\ud50c\uc758 \uc81c\uc655",
        "\u0e23\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e32\u0e41\u0e2b\u0e48\u0e07\u0e42\u0e0b\u0e42\u0e25\u0e48\u0e40\u0e1e\u0e25\u0e40\u0e22\u0e2d\u0e23\u0e4c",
        "\u5355\u5237\u4e4b\u738b",
        "The King of Soloplay",
        "The Emperor of Solo Play"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The launch of the virtual reality game Warlord in the year 2035 changed the world.</p><p>Ahn Jaehyun was one of many who sought to change his fate within it.</p><p>But the price of devoting his entire life to the game was betrayal by the very comrades he trusted the most.</p><p>Having lost everything because of that betrayal, Jaehyun is given one more chance to start over.</p><p>\"I'm never playing with others again. Whether I win or lose, I'll do it all on my own, and show them exactly what that means.\"</p><p>While others roll dice to split the loot, Jaehyun is the one who takes it all for himself.</p><p>And so begins his thrilling, ruthless, solo-kill gaming life!</p>",
      "cover": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/emperor-of-solo-play.0d7530.webp",
      "banner": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/banners/emperor-of-solo-play.jpg",
