      "description": "<p>After being in a coma for three years due to a traffic accident, I woke up to find that the world of a certain game had become reality.</p><p>In a world where systems and summons are the norm, people say that in order to climb the \u201cTower of Trials,\u201d they must find \u201cGod Ji-nu.\u201d</p><p>But\u2026 God Ji-nu?</p><p>That\u2019s <strong>me</strong>.</p>",
