    {
      "id": 2185,
      "slug": "the-academys-sashimi-sword-master",
      "title": "The Academy\u2019s Sashimi Sword Master",
      "alt_titles": [
        "Th\u1ed1ng L\u0129nh H\u1ecdc Vi\u1ec7n Ch\u1ec9 B\u1eb1ng Dao Sashimi",
        "\u523a\u8eab\u5200\u5236\u9738\u82f1\u96c4\u5b66\u9662",
        "\u523a\u8eab\u5305\u4e01\u3067\u30a2\u30ab\u30c7\u30df\u30fc\u7121\u53cc",
        "\uc0ac\uc2dc\ubbf8 \ud55c \uc790\ub8e8\ub85c \uc544\uce74\ub370\ubbf8\ub97c \uc539\uc5b4\uba39\uc74c",
        "Conquering the Academy With Just a Sashimi Knife",
        "\u0e0a\u0e33\u0e41\u0e2b\u0e25\u0e30\u0e2d\u0e30\u0e04\u0e32\u0e40\u0e14\u0e21\u0e35\u0e14\u0e49\u0e27\u0e22\u0e21\u0e35\u0e14\u0e41\u0e25\u0e48\u0e1b\u0e25\u0e32",
        "I Took Over the Academy With a Single Sashimi Knife",
        "\u523a\u8eab\u5200\u82f1\u96c4\u6a6b\u6383\u5b78\u9662",
        "Conquistando la Academia con solo un Cuchillo de Sashimi"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Chef Kim, Korea's legendary sashimi master, is transported into the world of Blessing M, a mobile game he once played. But instead of being a hero, he finds himself as Geomma Kang, a mere background extra. Forced into a new life, Geomma discovers a new power: the Blessing of the Blade God. Now, to survive in this game-like world, he must slice through challenges and enemies alike. Will his unmatched skills in the kitchen be enough to carve out a new destiny?</p>",
      "cover": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/the-academys-sashimi-sword-master.7f20f6.webp",
      "status": "ongoing",
